-- `deleted_at` was stamped with the database's NOW() while sessions ran in the server's own zone,
-- so it holds local wall-clock time where Drizzle stores and reads UTC (db/connection.ts). Sessions
-- run in UTC from now on; this moves the stamps already written by the server's offset.
--
